WEBVTT - UMAHZ Clinic Setup Tutorial

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Getting started with UMAHZ: setting up your clinic account in under 3 minutes.

2
00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:18.000
Step 1: Choose your clinic subdomain and enter your practice details.

3
00:00:18.500 --> 00:00:35.000
Step 2: Select your practice disciplines, including Acupuncture, Massage Therapy, and custom modalities.

4
00:00:35.500 --> 00:00:55.000
Step 3: Configure treatment rooms, location addresses, and business hours.

5
00:00:55.500 --> 00:01:20.000
Step 4: Invite practitioners and reception staff with granular permission roles.

6
00:01:20.500 --> 00:01:50.000
Step 5: Connect Stripe to accept online client booking deposits and card payments.

7
00:01:50.500 --> 00:02:25.000
Step 6: Customize your online booking portal and embed it on your website.

8
00:02:25.500 --> 00:02:45.000
Your clinic is now live and ready to welcome patients. Welcome to UMAHZ!

